WEBVTT

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.290
MEMORY

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.720
They ran this way!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.300
Find them!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.850
I'm gonna punish those kids!

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.100
Stop. They're advanced players.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.600
We'd all get a game-over.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.150
I found you.

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.870
Clive?

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.920
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.010
Future Choice

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.830
What?

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:37.510
Haruto!

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.020
They said you'll walk again
with some rehabilitation.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.860
I can understand
why you're confused.

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:56.570
You've been asleep for six years.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.240
I can't believe

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.990
I got a game-over in "Union."

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.620
I'm so glad...

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.630
we didn't give up.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.050
Hey, Asahi.

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:19.930
Do you remember
when I got game-over?

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:21.430
I'll never forget it.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:25.060
Haruto, you protected Nozomi

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.730
and took Purgatorio's attack.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:34.860
And then...

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:38.110
No. The person who took the attack was...

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:49.750
Let's take back
these past six years together.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.800
Come on! We were so worried!

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:03.390
Yeah! We thought
you'd never wake up.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.430
But...

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.890
-I'm glad.
-Yeah.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.020
Nozomi changed schools.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.980
She's sorry she can't make it.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.440
You guys, what about "Re'Union"?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:19.780
"Re'Union"?

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.200
What's that?

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:24.780
Don't you mean "Union"?

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.290
No.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.250
It's nothing.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:37.760
Are you saying

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.420
I've been dreaming this whole time?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.930
I finally got in.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:51.890
Elicia?

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:53.600
Good.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.190
I wouldn't be able to do anything
if you'd forgotten me.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:58.940
Hey.

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.700
What's going on?

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:05.700
We don't have much time.
I'll keep this short.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.580
This world you're in now was created

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.540
by the Prophet Art.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.830
The Prophet Art?
You mean Asahi's...?

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.590
You gotta be kidding!

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.920
That's only in the game!
That's impossible.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.880
The Senses from "Union"

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:26.140
can be used in reality
as well as in the game.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:29.350
Do you really think
I'm gonna believe that?

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.230
Then how do you interpret
this world you're in now?

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.110
Interpret?

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:43.650
They're saying I'm the one
who got game-over six years ago, not Asahi.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.780
But unlike Asahi,

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.200
I didn't die, I was asleep.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:49.450
Right.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:53.330
In this world you took
Purgatorio's attack six years ago,

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.830
and got a game-over.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.550
The other world resulted
from Asahi's decision to choose

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.460
a future in which she took
the attack herself.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:06.550
So you're saying that these past
six years I experienced

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.550
were created by Asahi?

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:10.310
She didn't create it.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.100
Asahi only chose one possibility
out of many.

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:15.480
Possibility?

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.650
The Prophet Art isn't the ability
to predict the future.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.570
It's the power to choose one

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:25.490
out of an infinite number
of possible futures.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:29.030
However, even Asahi wasn't aware of that.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:33.080
But how can a power
within the game become real?

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:38.210
There are still many unknowns about
the potential of the human brain.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:40.960
That's what the Senses are.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:45.630
"Union" is an online game,
but it's actually

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:49.890
a training ground for using
the Senses in the real world.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.100
No.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.560
It's a system that was constructed
to be a laboratory.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.730
Why would they do that?

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:00.020
In order to obtain the ultimate Sense,

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.820
the Prophet Art.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:06.900
They always wanted it.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:10.450
That's pretty much why "Union" was made.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:11.990
"They"?

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.990
Gnosis.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.250
Gnosis?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.920
They applied psychological stress
to Asahi

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.840
in an effort to force
the Prophet Art to awaken.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.380
Just like they planned,

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.510
Asahi used the Prophet Art...

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.510
And brought me to this world.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:36.020
She wanted to save you.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.480
We're out of time.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.070
I can't maintain
my existence here any longer.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.240
Hey!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.530
I still have a lot to ask!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:55.910
Haruto, you're the point of singularity.
I'm sure you'll...

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.460
I hope we meet again.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.920
Wait!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:11.800
What am I supposed to do now?

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:33.490
Clive said he might come here
to study abroad.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:37.240
Satsuki said we should invite Nozomi
and get together.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.950
Takanori was excited too.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.210
What's wrong?

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.920
Did I say something weird?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.590
I'm just relieved.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:49.300
You're all really close and happy.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:51.340
Of course we are!

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.970
Even if we're not in the game,

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:59.020
Subaru will last forever.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:04.230
I left your ring yesterday.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.990
We exchanged rings in the game.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.240
But not here, right?

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.240
So...

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.300
I'll protect you.

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:36.760
So you have to protect me too.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.510
Promise me, okay?

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.190
Haruto?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.520
You kept your promise.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.480
Twice.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.400
What do you mean?

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:53.150
But this world...

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:57.280
isn't the world where I belong.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.040
Haruto?

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.290
I promise.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:11.710
I'll make sure you'll never feel sad again.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:15.430
I'm going to reconnect Subaru's bond.

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:19.050
That's why I'm going back
to the other world.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.320
I have no idea
what you're talking about.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.900
I believe in you, Haruto.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.810
This is it!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.000
Haruto! Clive!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.510
Asahi. Satsuki.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.720
Haruto, are you okay?

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.010
What's going on? Clive!

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:46.140
I saw it. You...

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.270
Six years passed, situations change.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.520
Situation?

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.110
I'm an enemy of Subaru now.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.030
Hey.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.160
Stop using that face and that voice...

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.240
to defile Clive!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:08.540
Our shapeshifter
would never betray his friends.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.750
He's a twisted guy, but he's loyal.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.630
Show us who you really are!

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:22.010
You sure talk big, but you can't
bring yourself to stab me.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.010
Is that what you think?

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.600
Clive taught me a long time ago
that shapeshifters

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:37.030
can't maintain changes in appearance
against the Fighting Sense.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.400
You bastard!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.540
VANISHING WITCH
ALTER PERIOD

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.760
I never imagined you'd actually come back.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:01.880
What does he mean?

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:03.510
I'll tell you later.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:06.010
Just know that he's our enemy,

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.520
and we're going to beat him together!

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.480
Got it! We'll make him pay
for disguising himself as Clive and deceiving us!

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:15.770
Explain yourself later!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:35.830
Simon of the sixth Hollowchaos of Gnosis

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.300
is about to send you to your grave!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:44.050
Heed my will. Aegir!

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:55.560
He merged with the boss monster?

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.570
Sorry, you two, I'm gonna be rough!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.550
Four-sided Stronghold!

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.720
What a splendid defense line.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.060
It must be hard to maintain.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.560
Damn it.

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:39.520
If I can just pull out Pleiades...

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.750
Satsuki!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:04.880
Coeur de Lion,
I'm going to kill her if you move.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:10.890
Well, Asahi, this is just perfect.

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:15.140
Your power will awaken
to save your friend from danger.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.890
What are you saying?

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.940
I don't understand at all!

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.440
Damn. What should I do?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.700
Awaken, Asahi.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.700
Stop.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.580
Expand your possibilities.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.410
Show us the world we want.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.160
It's easy.

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:41.420
Accept the threat to your friend
as a threat towards yourself.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:42.710
Please.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.800
Satsuki!

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.140
Stop, Asahi!

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:57.180
Save Satsuki!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:05.360
Satsuki!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:17.950
Subaru is pretty weak
when it comes to backdoor attacks.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.790
Alwida?

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.840
No, it's not her.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:36.890
Hey.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:38.730
Clive!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.610
What's going on?

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:46.020
Hey, Satsuki.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:48.440
It's a long story.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:52.450
I never imagined I'd meet the real Clive.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:57.120
Hello, you imposter.
Thanks for taking care of my friends.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.910
Are you three ready?

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.750
Yeah.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.500
We're counting on you, Clive.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:08.630
Leave it up to me.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:14.010
Here we go.

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:19.770
You already lost,
the moment you picked a fight with us.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:24.770
There's just one more of you.
That doesn't change anything.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:29.570
Now, watch this.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.400
All of you, get away!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:35.410
Tall Hammer!

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.960
Haruto.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:58.600
I didn't expect you to endure that attack.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:03.560
Though, it looks like your friends couldn't.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:09.400
Satsuki?

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:11.150
Clive?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.990
No.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.320
You underestimated me.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:20.450
You won't survive this time.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.660
-This is bad!
-Asahi.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:27.630
If you don't want Coeur de Lion
to end up like that too,

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.670
come with me.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:34.880
I'd appreciate it
if you didn't assume I was dead.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:49.690
Impossible! You bastards!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.400
We barely escaped.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.150
We escaped using my wind elemental.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:58.280
I transformed our bodies into lightning
to avoid damage.

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:02.160
I knew Asahi would be okay with Haruto.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.790
Satsuki!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.250
In that split second...

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:09.080
If you keep making exciting choices,

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:11.670
everything comes together at the end.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.220
Yeah, even without talking.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:18.890
Yeah.

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:20.550
Haruto, please.

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.430
All right.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.980
Go!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.520
Take that!

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.280
No way!

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.990
It's a light elemental bomb I made
for constraining people.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.330
Accept your fate. Tighten!

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:55.510
Haruto, get Pleiades!

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.840
I won't let you!

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.390
You bastards.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.730
Don't underestimate me!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.230
I'll never let you go again.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.230
This is Subaru's.

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.360
That's it.

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:20.740
Clive! Satsuki! Asahi!

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.530
All right!

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.740
Take it, Haruto!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.790
Link Bullet!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.540
Connect!

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.300
Penetrate!

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.300
Pleiades!

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:03.450
MEMORY

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:14.330
What happened?

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:18.340
I'm sorry, I used you all as bait.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.010
You didn't betray us.

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:23.510
You're so confusing.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.850
I'd never betray you guys.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:32.440
Because this is where I can escape boredom.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:44.110
Clive, these last six years...

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:46.660
Oh, before that...

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:49.580
-Aegir dropped it?
-Yeah.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:51.870
What is it?

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.920
Just take it for now, Asahi.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:57.380
Okay.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.100
Who are you?

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.480
You infiltrated this space?

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:17.900
Mortar Thrust!

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.450
Asahi.

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.700
Omnipotens Vanish!

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:33.160
She's trying to lock her Sense!

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:34.410
Stop her!

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:36.920
Asahi?

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:54.060
What if this is a piece...

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:56.730
Of that red stone.

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:41.040
All I did was delay their plans.

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:46.090
I'll save them next time.

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:50.050
I'll save Asahi and the future.

00:23:50.970 --> 00:23:53.340
Right, everyone?

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:58.470
Now that Clive is back,
all we need is Nozomi.

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:01.350
No. We must solve the mystery
of the red stone.

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:05.190
And who's that girl in the vision?

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:07.570
Episode 9,
"The Chance Meeting of the Stars."

00:24:07.730 --> 00:24:09.780
Omnipotens Vanish!
